rs, tanks and throwers\u2014 assaults an abandoned factory. Your mission: survive.\n\n- 4 zombie types with distinct behaviors: tanks soak up bullets, throwers lob dodgeable projectiles.\n- Headshots: +100 points and a credit bonus.\n- Credit economy: every kill pays out. Spend on medkits (+50 HP) or upgrade your pistol through 3 levels (2 \u2192 3 \u2192 5 shots/sec, more damage, bigger rounds).\n- Grenades: throw them with an arm gesture.\n- Wrist upgrade menu: glance at your watch and buy without putting down your weapon.\n- Procedural arena: an abandoned factory with flickering, dying lights.\n\nTrue local co-op: up to 4 headsets (Quest 2 and Quest 3) in one room, each with its own avatar, hands and weapon. The host creates the room and shares a 3-digit code; the rest join in seconds.\n\nNo microtransactions, no ads, no data collection. A one-time-purchase experience built to play with friends.", "short_description": "4-player local co-op VR zombie survival. Survive 5-minute waves in an abandoned factory: shoot, upgrade your weapon, hold the line."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vertigoapps.com/privacidad.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "V\u00e9rtigo Apps", "support_website_url": "https://vertigoapps.com/", "website_url": "https://vertigoapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es_VE"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "suppor